include LICENSE README.md pyproject.toml
recursive-include src/spsheaf *.py
recursive-include examples quickstart.py tutorial.ipynb
prune experiments
prune benchmarks
prune figures
prune reported
prune tests
prune tools
prune docs
prune data
prune _staging
prune _to_delete
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] .DS_Store
